B.a8e=new A.jt("Two pipe kinds, like a modular synth:\n- PCM (audio): bipolar samples; the *_pcm pipes/sockets.\n- CV (control): pitch / gate / trig / modulation. Any CV pipe fits any CV\n  socket; you just can't cross PCM<->CV. Conventions (UI hints, not rules):\n    \xb7 pitch CV is 1V/oct: +1.0 = one octave up, 0.0 = no change.\n    \xb7 gate/trig: high >= 0.5. Gate = note length; trig = a 1-sample pulse.\nEach filter's optional CV sidebands are listed in its registry entry.\nUnwired CV inputs fall back to a sensible default; unwired PCM to silence.")
